This product includes software developed at the MIT SPARK Lab and the MIT
Robust Robotics Group for the Awesome-DCIST-T4 (ADT4) project.

The robot models in frontend/public/models (spot.glb, husky.glb) are derived from
third-party robot meshes and keep their sources' terms; see
frontend/public/models/README.md:
- spot.glb: Spot meshes from robustrobotics/spot_tools (MIT, Copyright 2025 Robust
  Robotics Group), following Boston Dynamics' Spot robot model.
- husky.glb: Husky A200 meshes from Clearpath Robotics' clearpath_platform_description
  (BSD-3-Clause, Copyright Clearpath Robotics, Inc.).
